WEBVTT

00:00:21.298 --> 00:00:24.301
I wish I could have
taught you this, son.

00:00:24.345 --> 00:00:25.940
It's okay, Dad. I'm... [DISTANT CLINKING]

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.653
[ALL GASPING]

00:00:32.483 --> 00:00:34.050
He's here.

00:00:34.094 --> 00:00:35.399
[ALL MURMURING]

00:00:39.055 --> 00:00:40.246
[SNORTS]

00:00:47.411 --> 00:00:50.240
[GRUNTING]

00:00:58.379 --> 00:00:59.946
Wow!

00:01:01.034 --> 00:01:03.214
That's what I call
a Dramatic Entrance!

00:01:07.010 --> 00:01:10.130
Ha-ha! You must be
the Dragon Warrior.

00:01:10.173 --> 00:01:13.176
And you must be Kai!

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:16.055
Beast of Vengeance,
Maker of Widows!

00:01:16.745 --> 00:01:20.314
Yes! Finally!
Thank you!

00:01:20.357 --> 00:01:22.425
Almost makes me wanna
spare your life.

00:01:22.438 --> 00:01:23.926
Oh, you wanna spare me?

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:25.928
How about you spare me
the chit-chat?

00:01:25.972 --> 00:01:28.017
All right?
Let's do this.

00:01:28.061 --> 00:01:30.237
I'm going to take
your chi...

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:32.717
then the chi
of every panda in the...

00:01:32.761 --> 00:01:34.284
Oh! Chit-chat!

00:01:34.328 --> 00:01:35.851
In this... Chitty-chitty chat-chat.

00:01:35.894 --> 00:01:37.325
In... Chat, chat, chat.

00:01:37.896 --> 00:01:39.246
In the...Chit-chat!

00:01:39.289 --> 00:01:41.596
Oh, you pudgy little...
[GROWLS]

00:01:46.209 --> 00:01:47.776
Round them all up.

00:02:01.877 --> 00:02:04.314
[GASPS] Oh, no. It's true.

00:02:04.358 --> 00:02:06.490
You guys have all been
turned green!

00:02:06.534 --> 00:02:09.330
Except for you, Mantis.
You were already green.

00:02:11.191 --> 00:02:12.648
Now? Wait for the signal.

00:02:12.675 --> 00:02:13.802
[YELLS]

00:02:14.933 --> 00:02:16.304
Here we go!

00:02:18.981 --> 00:02:20.248
[SNORTS]

00:02:26.989 --> 00:02:28.208
Dumpling Squad!

00:02:28.251 --> 00:02:30.079
Ready?Go time!

00:02:30.123 --> 00:02:32.012
Belly!Gong!

00:02:32.995 --> 00:02:34.438
BOTH: Whoo!

00:02:35.519 --> 00:02:36.912
Seriously?

00:02:36.955 --> 00:02:38.484
Yeah! Whoo! We did it! Whoo-hoo!

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:40.089
Sorry, Crane.

00:02:40.133 --> 00:02:41.429
[CLUCKS]

00:02:41.525 --> 00:02:42.876
[LAUGHS]

00:02:43.571 --> 00:02:44.702
[GRUNTS]

00:02:44.746 --> 00:02:45.969
[YELPS]

00:02:48.489 --> 00:02:50.971
Spring Roll Squad!
Time for some takeout!

00:02:51.144 --> 00:02:52.687
[ALL GRUNTING]

00:02:55.539 --> 00:02:56.776
[CLUCKS]

00:02:57.846 --> 00:02:58.934
[ALL CHEERING] PO: Yoo-hoo!

00:02:59.717 --> 00:03:00.805
Over here, Mr. Jombie!

00:03:05.593 --> 00:03:07.116
[LAUGHING]

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:08.465
I don't know
who you are, either.

00:03:09.075 --> 00:03:10.384
Noodle Squad!

00:03:13.731 --> 00:03:15.342
Get ready to dance...

00:03:15.385 --> 00:03:16.908
with danger!

00:03:16.952 --> 00:03:18.312
[YELLS]

00:03:20.999 --> 00:03:22.333
Oh, sweet!

00:03:27.049 --> 00:03:28.353
[EXCLAIMING IN DISBELIEF]

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:35.275
Stripy Baby!

00:03:35.318 --> 00:03:36.416
[GASPS] Oh, no.

00:03:36.439 --> 00:03:37.712
Whee!

00:03:37.755 --> 00:03:39.888
[GRUNTING] [GIGGLING]

00:03:41.019 --> 00:03:42.431
Do it. You're mean!

00:03:48.244 --> 00:03:49.463
BAO: Fire!

00:03:52.422 --> 00:03:54.555
[GROWLING]

00:03:55.425 --> 00:03:57.471
BAO: Fire in the hole!Oh!

00:03:57.906 --> 00:03:59.081
Yes!

00:03:59.125 --> 00:04:00.909
All right, kids!

00:04:00.952 --> 00:04:02.353
You got it, guys!

00:04:06.132 --> 00:04:07.445
Oh, no! Master Shifu!

00:04:09.222 --> 00:04:10.538
I can't hit Shifu!

00:04:12.225 --> 00:04:13.449
I can!

00:04:13.661 --> 00:04:15.506
And so can I.

00:04:17.186 --> 00:04:18.794
BOTH: Double-Dad Defense!

00:04:18.857 --> 00:04:20.058
Left, Dad! Right, Dad!

00:04:20.102 --> 00:04:21.321
Thanks, Dad!

00:04:21.364 --> 00:04:22.691
Back at you, Dad.

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:24.735
We've got this, son!

00:04:25.151 --> 00:04:26.195
[LAUGHS] Go, Dads!

00:04:26.239 --> 00:04:27.655
LI: Yeah!

00:04:30.808 --> 00:04:32.332
Yeah! [LAUGHS]

00:04:32.375 --> 00:04:33.681
We got them now.

00:04:33.724 --> 00:04:36.118
[SNORTS] Stop.
Stop! Enough!

00:04:38.686 --> 00:04:39.856
Get out...

00:04:41.341 --> 00:04:42.342
[LAUGHING]

00:04:42.385 --> 00:04:43.649
[GASPS]

00:04:43.908 --> 00:04:44.953
Let's finish this.

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:48.736
BOTH: That's our boy!

00:04:51.916 --> 00:04:53.163
[GRUNTS]

00:05:04.377 --> 00:05:07.358
Sorry, buddy. Gotta send you
back to the Spirit Realm.

00:05:07.402 --> 00:05:08.736
Skadoosh!

00:05:10.718 --> 00:05:13.764
Okay, that didn't work.
Let me try one more time.

00:05:13.808 --> 00:05:17.246
Skadoosh! Skadoosh. Skadoosh.
Skadoo... What the...?

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:19.117
Hold on, wait!
It's working.

00:05:19.161 --> 00:05:21.207
No. No!

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.860
[IMITATING CHOKING]

00:05:24.166 --> 00:05:25.907
[LAUGHING]

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:28.562
No, it's not.

00:05:28.605 --> 00:05:30.252
Did Oogway teach you
that little trick?

00:05:30.433 --> 00:05:32.087
Too bad.

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:34.350
It only works
on mortals.

00:05:34.394 --> 00:05:37.919
And I am
a Spirit Warrior.

00:05:37.962 --> 00:05:39.223
Come!

00:05:49.457 --> 00:05:50.714
[YELPS]

00:05:51.454 --> 00:05:52.760
[BOTH GRUNTING]

00:05:54.849 --> 00:05:55.850
[PO GROANS]

00:05:58.896 --> 00:06:00.202
[SNORTS]

00:06:00.246 --> 00:06:01.278
[GASPS] [KAI YELLING]

00:06:01.856 --> 00:06:03.074
[BOTH GRUNTING]

00:06:08.079 --> 00:06:09.252
PO: Whoa!

00:06:09.994 --> 00:06:11.138
[KAI GRUNTS]

00:06:15.391 --> 00:06:17.263
[GROANING]

00:06:23.051 --> 00:06:24.243
[ALL GASPING]

00:06:24.792 --> 00:06:25.996
Son! [GASPS]

00:06:26.228 --> 00:06:27.447
Po!

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:29.231
[PANDAS MURMURING]

00:06:29.797 --> 00:06:31.189
I was wrong.

00:06:31.233 --> 00:06:34.019
I'm sorry. Run. Run!

00:06:36.107 --> 00:06:37.371
[PANDAS GASPING]

00:06:42.549 --> 00:06:43.550
[KAI LAUGHING]

00:06:46.161 --> 00:06:48.163
So, Oogway...

00:06:48.206 --> 00:06:51.906
this was the one
destined to stop me?

00:06:51.949 --> 00:06:53.777
I will have his chi...

00:06:54.517 --> 00:06:56.824
and then all of theirs!

00:06:56.867 --> 00:06:58.826
[ALL SCREAMING]

00:07:06.007 --> 00:07:07.095
[LEI LEI CRYING]

00:07:12.274 --> 00:07:14.276
And you... [LAUGHING]

00:07:15.557 --> 00:07:17.087
You really thought you could

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:19.915
send me back
to the Spirit Realm?

00:07:23.981 --> 00:07:25.809
[LAUGHING]

00:07:25.853 --> 00:07:28.251
You are just
a stupid mortal.

00:07:29.291 --> 00:07:31.525
It only works on mortals.

00:07:33.861 --> 00:07:36.221
You're right.
I can't send you there.

00:07:37.386 --> 00:07:39.133
But I can take you there.

00:07:39.388 --> 00:07:40.423
What's that? [PANDAS GASPING]

00:07:41.134 --> 00:07:42.348
What?

00:07:43.131 --> 00:07:44.629
Po! Son!

00:07:45.176 --> 00:07:46.613
Skadoosh.

00:07:46.656 --> 00:07:47.788
BOTH: Son!

00:07:48.571 --> 00:07:49.845
No!

00:07:51.487 --> 00:07:52.680
[ALL GASPING]

00:07:59.713 --> 00:08:01.758
[PANDAS MURMURING]

